Description:
 linuxmuster-tools7 - Tools for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-tools7 (7.3.48) lmn73; urgency=medium
 .
   * [linbo][ldapconnector] Fix case sensitive names for image.status, so
     that the last sync date is found whatever the case of the file name.
   * [ldapconnector] Fix ValueError when the member list of a schoolclass
     subgroup ends up empty: the attribute is now deleted instead of being
     set to an empty list.
   * [lmnfile] Accept negative values in config files, so that the
     unlimited quota (-1) of school.conf is read as an integer.
